window.products.push({"id":193014,"name":"JUPA Place PEVA Shower Curtain Liner - Heavy Duty Bathroom Curtains - Eco-Friendly Bathtub Curtain - (Blue & Grey Fireworks)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F10MCmAYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Water-Repellant & Safe Material: The shower curtain does not keep or gather soap scum or any other stains along the edges. The shower curtain repels water right off into the tube. It is made of heavy-duty PEVA plastic material. Unique Pattern Design: The bathroom shower curtain with a modern bohemian design is made of high-quality material. The JUPA Place Modern Shower Curtain also features a modern and elegant design, providing a stylish touch to your bathroom decor. Its hassle-free installation ensures it can be easily set up, making it the perfect solution for those looking to upgrade their bathroom in a snap.The shower curtain design provides you with enough privacy without affecting the light in the shower and has a higher value than the ordinary transparent liner. Durable and Eco Friendly: The waterproof shower curtain is durable and eco-friendly, which is free of chemicals, and odorless. We especially chose thick material to ensure the bathroom shower curtain goes down nicely. Perfect Standard Size: This 72\" by 72\" plastic shower curtain liner perfectly fits a variety of standard-sized bathtubs and shower rooms. Additionally, we will provide you with 12 additional plastic hooks that may be used with any kind of shower curtain rod, whether it is straight or curved. Easy to Clean & Care: The shower curtain liner is easy to care for and convenient to use. No machine wash. After a shower, you can simply wipe clean with soap and water for easy cleaning. Wipe it with a damp cloth and keep it open to air-dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F10MCmAYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUPA Place","source_asin":"B0B4X3PHKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4X3PHKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4X3PHKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
