window.products.push({"id":193038,"name":"Primitives by Kathy Words of Wisdom Inspirational Keepsake Box, Empower","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gIVx9ApdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An uplifting Words of Wisdom in a wooden keepsake box. Contains 40 double-sided themed phrases to provide daily words of inspiration. Complements well with coordinating pieces in collection for an inspiring display. CAREFULLY BUY ONLY FROM or trusted partners to authentic Primitives By Kathy gifts and decor with premium quality printing, stitching, and fabrics. In 1997, Kathy made her first \"primitive candle box\" by hand, taking care into each detail from the sanded edges to the type of ribbon tied on the wire handles, each was a work of passion. As Primitives by Kathy grows, the company works to give back, starting with an initial relationship with Goodwill Services and expanding into several more charitable causes held both by the company and those the company supports on behalf of their employees. They are constantly inspired by the people, places and things around us. Kathy travels the world to pull inspiration first hand from cultures around the globe. Look for all of Primitives by Kathy for inspirational, fun, sarcastic, and heart-warming gifts and home decor. You'll want to have one for yourself and another for someone you care about.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gIVx9ApdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primitives by Kathy","source_asin":"B07MC96DKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MC96DKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MC96DKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":193039,"name":"Antigua Lux Premium Bamboo Cheese Board and Knife Set - Pure Organic Wooden Charcuterie Board - 4-Piece Stainless Steel Cutlery in Slide-Out Drawer - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912VGrWO6QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you the type who loves having guests over? There are few things more fun and satisfying than playing host to your friends. But entertaining guests is hard work, though, and there’s always so many things to prepare. You need to save time wherever possible so that you can focus on what really matters: the people. Why not make the prep work a little easier on yourself, and add a stylish new addition to your kitchen at the same time? Make every party more enjoyable with the Premium Bamboo Cheese Board Set by Antigua Lux! Our bamboo board set has multiple features that make putting together your cheese and charcuterie platter a total breeze! It boasts plenty of room for a wide variety of cheeses and meats, with special grooves for holding crackers, biscuits, fruits, nuts or other complementing foodstuffs along the side. This product also comes with a set of high-grade stainless steel cutlery. It can be hidden in the slide-out compartment - out of anyone’s way until they’re needed. The result is a stylish, elegant looking board that takes seconds to set up. Made entirely with organic, renewable bamboo, our cheese board is perfect for the eco-aware shopper. The bamboo also prevents any sticking smells or flavors, so your crackers don’t end up tasting like yesterday’s brie. More reasons to love this wonderful dining table centerpiece: ✅ Wide area for holding cheese, meats and fruits ✅ Lightweight and portable ✅ Discreet cutlery compartment ✅ Easy to clean with no residual smells ✅ Durable and knife friendly – no marks from cutting! Host memorable parties every time. Add this Premium Bamboo Cheese Board Set by Antigua Lux to your cart today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912VGrWO6QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antigua Lux","source_asin":"B07VBKRQ5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBKRQ5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBKRQ5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
