window.products.push({"id":193073,"name":"Mom to be Sash - Soft, Blue Satin with Silver Glitter - Baby Sash for Mom - Baby Boy or Twins - Neutral - Best Baby Celebration Gift or Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q3tZABP0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Celebrate your coming bundle of joy with an adorable sash keepsake that will remind you of this unforgettable experience! Your baby shower is one of the last few times that you get to put yourself first; trust us, that baby is going to command a lot of attention! That's why you need to make the moment truly memorable with a beautiful blue \"Mom to Be\" satin sash that let's everyone celebrate you and what you've done to bring a beautiful baby into the world. Mom, you've worked hard to care for, grow and carry your child for months on end. It's time to be the center of attention if even for a day. So feel confident, happy and excited about your baby (or babies) by immortalizing the occasion with a gorgeous, silver-glittered sash that shows everyone how special you and your baby are on this perfect day! Features of our blue Mom to be Sash: · Made of Ultra Soft Satin · Blue in Color with Silver Glitter Lettering · Size: 32\" x 4\" (One Size Fits All) · Easy to Attach and Comfortable · A Perfect Gift for Pregnant Women Click \"Add to Cart\" above and get your Mom to Be Sash before the baby comes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q3tZABP0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bambini & Me","source_asin":"B0187P6FXA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0187P6FXA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0187P6FXA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":193074,"name":"Magnetic Poetry - Kids' French Kit - Ages 5 and Up - Words for Refrigerator - Write Poems and Letters on The Fridge - Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W6oWxvXiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Created with the help of native speakers, the Kids' French Kit features word tiles that are printed on two sides and stick both ways, with a French word on one side and its English translation on the other. Basic vocabulary builder, but good for adults who want to learn too. For ages 5 and up. CONTAINS - over 200 magnetic word tiles in a cute, colorful, giftable 4.5 x 6.5 inch box. Your child can write you messages, poems, or generative esoteric word art masterpieces whose meaning is lost even to them. They're not just fridge words, your child can write an ode on your commode, an elegy on your doorknob, a haiku on your car hood, or a novelette on your omelette maker. MIX AND MATCH WITH OTHER KITS - Tile height is 0.375 Inches, compatible with nearly all other Magnetic Poetry sets. As your child grows, expand with one of over dozens of other themed kits. The possibilities are endless! You can mix and match to create custom combinations, and custom gift ideas. Magnet words make a great bedroom, or locker decoration. They're also a perfect gift for burgeoning poetry lovers, or a gift for young writers of any kind. MADE IN THE USA - Magnetic Poetry sets are made in America, are nontoxic, and comply with all American and international safety guidelines and regulations. Magnetic Poetry is the inventor of the magnetic word tile, and we're still a small US company that takes great pride in every set we make. Read more about our company in the product description below. WARNING - Choking Hazard - Small parts. Not for children under 3 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W6oWxvXiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnetic Poetry","source_asin":"B000ND0A22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ND0A22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ND0A22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":193075,"name":"InterDesign Otto Framed Shower Curtain, White/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RpQXDw5BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a sophisticated, new look to your bathroom with the Otto Framed Shower Curtain by InterDesign. Designed with a double-sided ribbed pattern, this curtain features a clean white look with thick black framing for contrast, and will remain beautiful wash after wash. Our polyester fabrication adds superior performance to this sleek and stylish shower accessory. A reinforced top hem (inside interlining) has been added for increased structure and grommet hold. Metal grommets will not rust after prolonged exposure to moisture. The curtain is fade resistant and will retain the color much longer than 100% cotton curtains. Made of 100% Polyester.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RpQXDw5BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InterDesign","source_asin":"B00193DLMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193075","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00193DLMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00193DLMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
