window.products.push({"id":193135,"name":"Petgin 2pcs 10 Inch Knife Magnetic Strip-Upgraded Double-Row Magnet SUS304 Magnetic Knife Holder for Wall | Knife Magnet Strip No Drilling,Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411gRgcDGEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE-ROW MAGNET DESIGN – We bring you a NEW, UPGRADED10\" stainless steel knife magnetic strip, Built-in double-row magnet design, strong adsorption force, no need to worry about knives falling. Our chosen magnet has an even magnetic force across the bar allowing you to safely use the entire 10” length. The magnetic grip is very powerful, yet it only takes a gentle tug to release any knives. EASY INSTALLATION — This state of the art magnetic knife bar uses super glue type fastening system to install on the wall, No need to drill and no screws,Suitable for all kinds of walls. waterproof and moisture-proof without falling, Save your sanity and protect your walls. HIGHER QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL — Our stainless steel is of type 304, type 304 has a higher corrosion resistance which means that under normal environmental conditions, it has a lifetime durability (making it also more expensive). In comparison, type 201’s appearance can be affected within 1 years. SIMPLE & ELEGANT MODERN DESIGN – Our 10’’ magnetic knife holder for wall is made from high quality stainless steel and designed with a sleek, elegant appearance. The flat, space-saving magnetic bar has a modern design that fits into any kitchen style . The design of our bar and the simple , clean installation allows your knifes and stainless steel appliance to become a part of your kitchen décor! QUALITY ASSURANCE & SALE SERVICE — We offer guarantee and warranty. If you have any questions, please contact us, we will provide you with a satisfactory solution within 24 hours. Just add a shopping cart to buy, no worries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411gRgcDGEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Petgin","source_asin":"B09N3BLPQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N3BLPQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N3BLPQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
