window.products.push({"id":193137,"name":"Lightshare Cherry Blossom Tree 5FT 128 LED Lighted Tree for Decoration Inside and Outside, Home Patio Wedding Festival Christmas Decor, Warm White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KkhUhAUnL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Bring nature's beauty into your home: the pure handmade trunk and branches make each of our cherry blossom trees natural and unique. With the ornament of 128 warm white LED lights, the ambient glow of this artificial tree is wonderfully soothing and stunning. If your house is lack of some vitality and warmth, this lighted tree will be your perfect choice. Popular decoration choices for year-round holidays: The branches of the decorative tree are flexible yet sturdy to shape at will. You can hang hearts on the branches on a wedding or Valentine's Day, eggs on Easter, crystal balls at Christmas...Just create your own decorative style! Suitable for both inside and outside: 24V low voltage power supply makes this LED tree light safe to use both indoors and outdoors. You can use it as a floor lamp in your living room, or put it at the front porch to greet your guests and impress them, or set it in your patio garden to create a lovely atmosphere for a relaxing summer evening. The best gift for family and friends: simple packaging and convenient installation (no tools required) make this light tree a exquisite and impressive gift for birthdays, weddings, anniversaries, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas, holiday parties, etc. Quality Assurance: All of our LED tree lights come with a 180-day warranty. And We have the best customer service and quality control team to cover your back. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will solve your issues within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KkhUhAUnL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIGHTSHARE","source_asin":"B0C1MJSR21","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1MJSR21","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1MJSR21","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":193138,"name":"Lomonosov Porcelain Teapot Forget Me Not 3 cups","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T-7mECGwL._AC_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the world of Lomonosov Russian Porcelain !  The Imperial Russian Lomonosov Porcelain Manufactory was founded by Empress Elizabeth, Peter the Great's daughter, in 1744. Here the gifted Russian scientist Dmitry Vinogradov independently discovered the secret of making Russian porcelain and developed the technology for its manufacture and the later creation of Lomonosov Russia.  Three hundred years ago no one in Europe had any idea of the materials and techniques used in making porcelain. The Chinese kept the secrets of porcelain production. Only in the early 18th century in Saxony the alchemist Johan F. Bottger discovered a way to produce \"European\" hard paste porcelain. These developments did not escape the notice of Peter I. During his frequent visits to European countries, Peter I pursued his interest in the secrets of porcelain manufacture and he attempted to introduce it to Russia with the help of foreigners, but unsuccessfully. Peter I's idea to establish his own porcelain production was brought to life two decades later by his daughter, who was then Empress Elizabeth (1741-1761).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T-7mECGwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lomonosov Russia","source_asin":"B0062G6M44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0062G6M44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0062G6M44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
