window.products.push({"id":193142,"name":"Bluapple Produce Saver Refill Kit - Keep Fruits and Vegetables Fresh Longer, 8 Veggie and Fruit Saver Packets, Each Packet Lasts up to 3 Months, Ethyl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718U+rwTMxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR FRUITS AND VEGGIES FRESHER LONGER: Take advantage of the same technology that has been used in commercial shipping for decades! The Bluapple Produce Savers each have a 9g active ingredient packet inside that can last up to three (3) months to keep your fruits and veggies fresher longer! Bluapples sold separately. THROW AWAY LESS PRODUCE: Lengthen the amount of time it takes for your food to spoil, ripen, rot, or wilt with a Bluapple Produce Saver. Use this produce preserver or fruit saver to prevent food wastage and enjoy your lettuce, cucumber, avocado, onion, or watermelon in their best tasting, nutrient-rich condition. With Bluapple by your side, you can say goodbye to throwing away so much unused produce that has passed its prime. Conveniently reduce waste and trips to the store! HOW IT WORKS: By absorbing ethylene gas, the ripening process is slowed, giving you more time to enjoy your fruits and vegetables. It's a perfectly natural way to extend the life of your produce! REUSABLE PRODUCT: The Bluapple container is reusable. Replace the old packets with new ones every ninety (90) days to use the produce saver and ethylene gas absorber again. We supply you with 8 packets, each lasting for 3 months- enough refills for two (2) Bluapples for one year! BECAUSE WE CARE: Our vision is to provide an effective way to reduce food waste and preserve your shopping budget. Bluapple works hard to bring you reliable products made in the USA that can improve your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718U+rwTMxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BluApple","source_asin":"B005W6FFU2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005W6FFU2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005W6FFU2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
