window.products.push({"id":193274,"name":"Lacette 100% Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, 22 Momme 6A Soft Silk Pillow Case with Hidden Zipper, Gift Box, 600 Thread Count, Double Side Silk/Woo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gVL5-e4-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Two Sleeping Experiences – Lacette silk pillowcase features two fibers: A side is made of 100% natural 6A mulberry silk, which is more comfortable, breathable and skin-friendly than the satin pillowcase. B side is made of 100% organic wood pulp fiber, providing you with smooth and delicate sleep. It's easy to slip the pillow in and out and to secure the pillow overnight, thanks to a hidden zipper. Healthy Sleep for Facial Skin – 22 momme silk pillow case has a thread count of 600. Wrinkles-free mulberry silk side has 18 kinds of amino acids to prevent skin abrasion, reduce friction and wrinkles. The more hydrated your skin is, the fewer fine lines and wrinkles it will form. Take Care of Your Hair – Due to natural proteins, pure silk pillowcase can minimize split ends, frizz, and dryness, keeping hair glossy and smooth with no tangles or breaks. When you toss and turn at night, silk helps to retain the natural oils in your hair and keeps it smooth. The use of slip silk pillowcovers on a regular basis promotes healthier hair. Natural Temperature Regulator – Mulberry silk bedding is surprisingly breathable, wicking sweat away fast when you get too hot. Pure silk naturally regulates heat because of its porous structure fiber, keeping you cool in the summer while the B side keeps you warm in the winter. Have a good sleep all night with Lacette silk pillowcase! Perfect Gift – Carefully wrapped in an exquisite gift package, the Lacette silk pillowcase is an ideal present for Birthday, Mother’s Day, Father's Day, Valentine's Day, Christmas or Happy New Year. We also offer a wide range of colors and sizes to fit your taste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gVL5-e4-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lacette","source_asin":"B09WVRDDCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WVRDDCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WVRDDCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
