window.products.push({"id":193284,"name":"Cutting Boards for Kitchen, Plastic Chopping Board Set of 3 with Non-Slip Feet and Deep Drip Juice Groove, Easy Grip Handle, BPA Free, Non-porous, Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619wyVQsLLL._AC_SL1411_.jpg","description":"BEST CUTTING BOARDS SET FOR YOUR CHOPPING TASKS - What makes a good chopping board is the ability to protect your countertops, and make food preparation safer and easier, so we designed it with that in mind. Belwares has brought to you a premium set of 3 plastic cutting boards with different sizes perfect for all your prepping needs. The set includes: ✔ Large 16”x 10” ✔ Medium 13”x 8” and ✔ Small 10”x 6” SUPREME QUALITY - Our premium cutting board set is tailor-made to meet the needs of professional chefs, with home kitchen use in mind. We manufactured our cutting boards using plastic material that is sturdy, BPA-free, dishwasher safe and easy to clean. NON-SLIP & STABLE TO MAKE CUTTING EASIER & FASTER - The non-slip rubber feet are integrated on each cutting board to make slicing, dicing, and chopping foods and ingredients better without slipping or moving around; this ensures safety and protection while preventing unexpected cuts and injuries. What’s more, the groove around the edge of the board prevents tomato or meat juices from draining onto your countertop DISHWASHER SAFE FOR EASY CLEANING - Once you’re done cutting vegetables and other ingredients, you can toss them into the dishwasher so you never have to scrub again. The non-porous surface of our cutting boards mean they won’t absorb liquids and juices from raw beef, fish, or chicken, and they will resist staining from red peppers, broccoli, carrots, tomatoes and more 100% LIFETIME GUARANTEE - You can buy with confidence knowing that if for any reason our product doesn't exceed your expectations, ship it back to us for a full and prompt refund (or replace it if there’s a problem). All Belwares products are backed by 100% Satisfaction Guarantee and we’re dedicated to make you happy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619wyVQsLLL._AC_SL1411_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belwares","source_asin":"B0C5FJCBN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5FJCBN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5FJCBN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
