window.products.push({"id":193365,"name":"Bush Furniture Shoe Bench and Hall Tree, Vintage Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":214.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716WJM7ottL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevate your entryway's aesthetic and functionality with the entryway storage, making a bold statement as you step inside your home. The perfect combination of storage and seating, it offers a warm welcome and keeps your belongings organized, letting you hang your coats and hats on the hooks, stow your shoes in the cubbies, and relax on the bench after a tiring day. With its versatile design, the entryway coat rack seamlessly integrates into any decor, be it traditional country or modern urban style, creating an envy-worthy entryway that strikes the perfect balance between form and function. Key features: This entryway furniture is a perfect addition to welcome you home. The spacious entryway shoe and coat rack provides a comfortable seat to put on or take off your shoes. Four cubby shelves organize your entryway, keeping it clutter-free and tidy. The coat rack bench is ideal for placing your bags while you hang up your coat and get comfortable. The narrow hall tree has three Tumbled Pewter double prong hooks to hold your family's jackets, scarves, hats and more. Two adjustable shelves hold various items in any space, including a mudroom or hallway. Tapered legs, a curved base, and decorative wood detailing with eye-catching vertical accents inspired by timeless mission styling complement the casual homes of today. Available in your choice of seven attractive finish options, the country feel of the wooden hall tree with storage bench looks great even beyond your entryway. This mudroom tree is backed by the Bush Furniture 1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716WJM7ottL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B079788JGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079788JGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079788JGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
