window.products.push({"id":193432,"name":"Wartoon Tissue Paper Pom Poms Flowers for Wedding Birthday Party Baby Shower Decoration, 12 pieces - Black, Gold and Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QkibogZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Brightly cute colored and impressively charming festive decoration! Add these additional embellishments to wedding reception making it more lively and dimensional. Decorate your own party with paper hanging decorations of different bright colors.  Each pom pom comes with white ribbon and instructions. Pre-cut pieces for easy folding each sheet and fluff into shape to create beautiful and realistic paper flower pom-poms. Our tissue paper flowers are hand made using premium paper.They look great for a unique party decoration. Lightweight and easy to hang them from the ceiling, above a table, under the verandah, or from branches in trees. Perfect for any occasion: Birthday, Wedding, Christening Baby shower, Kitchen tea, Nursery decorations or any other celebration. ?Paper Pom Poms? Size and Quantity: 4pcs Black Pompoms paper flower ( 1x 8inch, 1x 10inch and 2x 12inch ). 4pcs Gold Pompoms paper flower ( 1x 8inch, 1x 10inch and 2x 12inch ). 4pcs Silver Pompoms paper flower ( 1x 8inch, 1x 10inch and 2x 12inch ). Easy to DIY and use. Instruction: How to DIY the paper pom poms Step 1 Unfold the tissue paper to the outside with the edges. The strips of tissue paper are joined together in the finished paper flower.  Step 2 Carefully pull the layers of tissue paper apart one by one. Step 3 When all the strips have been pulled apart, make a more round shape with your hand gently.  Step 4 Now, hang the paper flower anywhere you want. Package includes: 12 x Tissue Paper Pom Poms Flowers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QkibogZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wartoon","source_asin":"B071ZXKTTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071ZXKTTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071ZXKTTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":193433,"name":"Orka 12-Ounce Blue Silicone Steamers, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31S8ma95ToL._AC_.jpg","description":"The French call them papillotes; Orka calls them ingenious. These smart silicone steam \"cookers\" take time-pressed cooks and make them mini-gourmands. These are perfect for quick healthy and delicious microwave cooking. Of all the cooking methods, steaming is one of the healthiest. And Orka steamers make it super easy. Simply add your favorite meat, poultry or fish; add vegetables as desired, plus seasonings. No water or added oils or fats needed. Keep the flavor, vitamins and minerals and lose the fat. Cover, place in the microwave or oven and minutes later, dinner is served. The benefits are food cooks in its own juice, no water or fat required. Preserves essential vitamins and minerals. Enhances taste without mixing flavors. Fish cooks without drying; meat remains tender.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31S8ma95ToL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mastrad","source_asin":"B000VXKPOC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VXKPOC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VXKPOC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
