window.products.push({"id":193516,"name":"LED Digital Alarm Clock, Bedside Alarm Clock with Temperature, 4 Brightness and 13 Ringtones, 12/24H, Snooze, Voice Control Modern Digital Clocks for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WmxZf2qPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional & Modern Alarm Clock】LeadNear electronic clock is equipped with a large 5.7-inch LED display. The time numbers are very clear to read. The digital alarm clock supports time (12/24H) and temperature (℃/℉) display. Digital clock has 4 different brightness levels of lights, and there is a light adjustment button on the top, you can easily adjust it to your favourite brightness level. When it is plugged in, the screen will stay lit 【Best Dual Alarm Clock for Heavy Sleepers】LeadNear programmable alarm clock allows you to easily set two separate alarm clocks, suitable for couples or roommates who arrange different schedules. The snooze button with \"SNOOZE\" on the top means that you can prevent you from falling asleep too much. Just press the snooze button to enjoy extra sleep time. After 5 minutes, the alarm will sound again. The snooze button has been carefully designed for easy searching and is ideal for heavy sleepers 【Intelligent Voice Control】LeadNear bedside alarm clock has a built-in sound sensor. Say hello or lightly touch the desktop for more than 90dB in a short distance to wake up the alarm, and the screen will automatically turn off after 6s. After plugging in the USB charging cable, the screen will always keep the brightness; when not plugged in, the alarm clock will automatically enter the voice-activated energy-saving mode. If you want the clock to be always light on, please plug in the USB port 【Multiple Beautiful Ringtones Options】LeadNear digital led alarm clock is equipped with 13 different ringtones. You can choose comfortable alarm ringtones according to your personal preference. You can enjoy different ringtones every day, bid farewell to a single boring alarm ringtone. The volume of the modern clock can be adjusted freely. Don’t worry that too much sound will annoy you, or the sound is too weak to wake you from a deep sleep 【Easy to Set Up & Long Battery Life】Bedroom alarm clock is very easy to operate and comes with a USB charging cable. It has excellent battery life and charges the battery fully before first use, the bedside clock can be used continuously for 15 days. LeadNear digital alarm clock is very suitable for bedroom, living room, office, travel, etc. In addition, we provide a 180-day refund and a 365-day warranty service. If you have any questions, please contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WmxZf2qPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LeadNear","source_asin":"B08NDM94Q3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NDM94Q3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NDM94Q3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
