window.products.push({"id":193678,"name":"Polish Pottery Mini Cheese Lady DPLC or Christmas Posies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EnmVKdIBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Offered is one (1) brand new Polish Pottery stoneware lemon lady or mini-cheese lady in the Christmas Posies pattern. Some of our customers tell us she reminds them a bit of their Polish grandmother. She is a classic Polish pottery form. Everyone who collects Polish pottery needs at least one cheese lady. Note: the little faces may vary a bit from lady to lady. The mini cheese lady is perfect for serving individual pats of butter, a chocolate truffle or lemon for tea. She is also a charming way to present party favors, for trinket storage and more. For example, tie a place card to her with a ribbon for your next dinner party. And, of course, admire her on a shelf or counter between uses. You'll get lots of use out of this beauty. This would be a great addition to any Polish pottery collection and a charming gift. .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EnmVKdIBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poughkeepsie Polish Pottery & More","source_asin":"B07FYVXNRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FYVXNRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FYVXNRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":193679,"name":"VannySucci 31\" x 19\" Non Slip Bathroom Rugs Durable Soft Bath-Mat for Bathroom Machine Washable Bath Mats Rugs Water Absorbent Bathroom Mats with Fluf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rqU+BtjpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MACHINE WASHABLE AND DRYABLE: VannySucci 31\"x19\" bath mats can be machine washed and dried time and time again.Better than most other products which can only be dried or washed by machine a few times. COMFORTABLE AND LUXURIOUS: Our bath mat is covered with luxurious,thick and soft microfiber,so you can soothe your tired feet and shield toes from the cold floor.High density and plushness for sure.Great for bathroom,kitchen,bedroom,stair platform etc.Great gift idea for Christmas, Thanks Giving Day, Mothers Day, Fathers Day etc. ULTRA-ABSORBENT: Super thick microfiber fabric features ultra water absorbent and prevent your bathroom from splashing water while you're stepping out of bath tub or walking by the sink. Water is trapped in the microfiber, and our bath mat dries quickly and makes your floor tidy and clean. NON SLIP MAT AND DURABLE: With superior TPR backing our bath rug is much stronger and durable for long lasting use.Can prevent mat from sliding and that will hold up for years to come. Do not place mat on wet surface. Make sure floors are dry underneath the rug to prevent the rug from slipping. EASY TO WASH AND NO SHEDDING: For a deeper clean,you may wash this bath mat with machine in low speed mode.With durable utility polyester fibers and unique fiber-locking-tech,our bath mat won't shed,shrink,transform or turn rough after wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rqU+BtjpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VannySucci","source_asin":"B09BR678DT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BR678DT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BR678DT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
