window.products.push({"id":193694,"name":"Gravity Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set with Adjustable Coarseness Automatic Pepper and Salt Mill Battery Powered with Blue LED Light,One Hand Op","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y5gCGk7WL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"💗💗【UNIQUE DESIGN】This electric pepper grinder has a big and wide mouth spice container,acrylic body(BPA-FREE),adjustables ceramic blades and refillable--Just simply screws stainless steel top off the wide opening, and refill it easily with no mess.The modern and fashionable design is the perfect addition to any kitchen and also a great gift. ✅✅【AUTOMATIC OPERATION】Our gravity pepper grinder allow you will not need both of your hands to grind your spices. Better than other brands;you won’t even need to press a button! Simply flipped the grinder and you will have fresh ground spices! Convenient and funny. 💡💡【BLUE LED LIGHT】Why our automatic pepper grinder choose blue LED light? Blue light is not only bright but gentle,You can't imagine how warm and romantic it will be when you have dinner with family or lover;The blue light will turn ON with a simple wrist twist,you will easily be able to see amount of salt and pepper you put in your food. ✅✅【ADJUSTABLE MILL】Electric pepper mill with adjustable grinder, you can easily adjust the grinder knob to choose the coarseness of your spice,salt or peppercorn.Many grinding levels for your choice allows you to grinder your spices from coarse to fine. 💯💯【100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】Our pepper grinder mill offers a whole year warranty and lifetime support, you can request a full refund within 30 days of your order.totally no risk for you! Please rest assured to buy and use.If you have any other questions, please contact us ,we offer 7*24 friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y5gCGk7WL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALBEDO","source_asin":"B09B3FGZHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3FGZHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3FGZHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
