window.products.push({"id":193767,"name":"SAM + Ollie Boho Wood Coasters with Holder - Set of 6 Handmade Carved Wooden Absorbent Cold Drink or Hot Coffee Coasters, 4 Inch Squares<p></p>","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jmnF82MgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protect your table and granite or quartz countertops from white water stains with the rustic elegance of our hand carved wooden coasters. Designed for use with hot beverages, they're also the perfect accessory to use with your iced cold beverages. The boxed set comes with 6 natural Mango wood double-sided coasters, designed with a simple floral motif. Our coasters are easy to clean and maintain, simply wipe them down with a piece of dry or damp cloth. Each coaster is 4 inches in diameter, and ⅜ inches in thickness. Features: DECORATIVE COASTERS: Each package comes with 6 square wooden coasters and holder. Each are hand-carved and finished with a rustic, antiqued whitewash paint. All edges have been sanded and smoothed to prevent damage/scratching any table or surface. STYLE: This coaster set embodies the spirit of modern Bohemian or farmhouse rustic home decor. Each coaster features a natural wood finish with a protective coating on all sides to provide a clean aesthetic. If you desire a more rustic look, you could easily add additional distressing with a quick swipe of sandpaper. DIMENSIONS: Coasters are approximately 4” diameter by ⅜ inch thickness. Each coaster weighs less than 2 oz (less than 13 oz for the set) TABLE SAFE: Use these coasters as a barrier to protect wood furniture & countertops from water damage due to liquids & condensation. Use with cold or hot drinks to prevent water stains/circles and burn marks. MAINTENANCE: SAM + OLLIE coasters are naturally shatterproof & made from eco-friendly, all natural Mango Wood. Keep your coasters like new with a quick wipe from a damp cloth. (NOTE: these are not dishwasher safe)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jmnF82MgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAM + OLLIE FURNISHINGS","source_asin":"B08DJB8ZXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DJB8ZXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DJB8ZXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
