window.products.push({"id":193820,"name":"Custom Cut to Size, [Foiresoft Basic, White, W 95 x H 95 inch] Zebra Roller Blinds, Dual Layer Shades, Sheer or Privacy Light Control, Day and Night W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":201.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gZGolDODL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️ FEATURES: Foiresoft Zebra blinds & shades are designed in a combination of sheer mesh and opaque fabric slats for Light filtering on day and night. Suitable blinds for windows with different purpose such as kitchen blinds, bathroom window blinds, door blinds, light filtering blinds and so on. Window covering installation hardware of blinds for windows is included and Easy to install. Zebra Roller shades provide a dimly lit room rather than complete Blackout function. ✒️ Make Your Own Product: Zebra shades can be Customized 10 to 110 inches Wide and 20 to 115 inches Height following customer's customization details. If you want to check blinds Fabric color and quality first, you can place an order with Fabric Swatch Only (B09MRVMBQH). If you place an order with at least 1 window shade from us After Fabric sample order, we will arrange Refund Fabric sample cost After delivery is completed. If you have difficulty with customization, please contact us. ❣️ How To Customize the Product: Please select Larger Standard Height size with least gap from your measured Height size. If you need W 34 1/4 X H 50 inch, please select W 34 X H 55 inch, Click [Customization Now] button on the Top Right side of Product page and follow instruction to place a Custom order. As we send you Customization details in 24 hours, please CHECK your email After order placement. The Product will be shipped by expedited within 3 working days after the order is confirmed. ⏱️ Fast customer response within 24 hours of working days: We always do our best to provide our customers with Professional customer service with Premium quality products. Blinds and shades or components can be Replaced Without Return in case of Defects, Damage or any issue responsible for us. If you have any issue with your products, please provide us pictures related issue within 30 days from receipt day. Once we get it, we will get back to you with solution. ✔️ IMPORTANT✔️: For detailed instruction, please watch our video instruction on the last part of image section. All window blinds sizes are based on the blind TOP Header width and Have TOTAL [W 1/8 inch] Deduction for Each item for perfect fitting. Actual fabric width will be about 1.5 inches smaller than the header width to allow for the top mechanism. In case of very thin, bay or almost no-frame windows, please consider measuring and installing by Outside Mount.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gZGolDODL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foiresoft","source_asin":"B01J0N5EAI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J0N5EAI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J0N5EAI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":193821,"name":"KSHG Odorless No Sharp Edge Protection Table Cover Clear Plastic Desk Protector 20×60 Inch 1.5mm Thickness Waterproof Table Cover Dresser Coffee Dinin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EBXAKA4RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Version 2.0: Odorless】No plastic smell is one of the biggest features of the KSHG table cover protector. Also, The corners of the dining table cover of each style and size are rounded, in line with the modern table&desk design, which can prevent pregnant women, kids, and the elderly from being injured. Help you enjoy a better and safer desktop protection experience. 【Version 3.0: No Sharp Edge】No Sharp Edge is another biggest features of the KSHG table cover protector. When you put your arm on the edge of the table, the table mat with the right-angle edge will leave a visible Red indentation on your arm. And KSHG 60° cut edge table cover will protect you from the indentation. 【Transparent & Elegant】KSHG CLEAR table cover style has 100% transparency, you can clearly see the pattern and texture of your beloved table. The table cover will protect various furniture tops and surfaces: dining table, office computer table, wooden table, marble, glass, dresser, coffee, and end table, chest table, nightstand, countertop. Also, it can be used for desk pads and table mats. 【Eco-friendly & Durable】KSHG table cover is made of high-quality VINYL material, and it can be used for 10 years under normal conditions without deformation or deterioration. / Two Thickness:1.5mm, 2mm. / Heat Resistant: 2mm thickness style, max to 100 ℃ or 212℉, which is recommended for kitchen table and dining table; 1.5mm style, max to 90 ℃ or 194℉. 【Worried About Bubbles & Unfolding?】 About bubbles: When the CLEAR table cover is used on a smooth or glass desktop, some air bubbles may appear occasionally. And the FROSTED style will never have bubbles.Therefore, we recommend that some tabletop should use FROSTED style: glass, marble, painted and lacquered desktop, polished smooth wooden tabletop. About unfolding: unroll it and spread it on the table. Then warm it with a hairdryer to soften it, and press it with heavy items for a while.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EBXAKA4RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KSHG","source_asin":"B08H59FW8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H59FW8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H59FW8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
