window.products.push({"id":193839,"name":"WRENSONGE Plaid Twin Comforter Set, 6 Pieces Blue Printed and Spliced Plaid Herringbone Bedding Set, Microfiber Soft Farmhouse Comforter Set with Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913AHHIauWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Plaid Spliced Design】It is a spliced comforter with unique rhombus plaid pattern and herringbone print . Unlike ordinary plaid comforter sets, our bedding sets add button embellishments which is more fashionable in farmhouse style! 【Ultra Soft, Warm & Lightweight】Our plaid printed comforter sets are crafted from 100% premium microfiber. Softer to the touch! Stuffed with 240gsm cloud filling for long-lasting fluff and warmth by our exquisite craftsmanship. 【6 Pieces Twin Size Bedding Set】1 Twin Comforter 66\" x 90\", 1 Pillow Shams 20\" x 26\", 1 Twin Fitted Sheet 39\" W x 75\" L + 14\"（There is a fitted pocket for easy storage）, 1 Twin Flat Sheet 66\" W x 96\" L+4\", 1 Standard Pillowcase 20\" W x 30\"+4\"（Envelope mouth, easy to replace）, 1 Decor Pillow 12\" x 16\". 【Easy to Care】The tight stitching design prevents the filling in the comforter from shifting, leaking, or bunching up. Machine washable in cold water separately, gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not bleach or iron. Décor pillow spot clean only. 【Value Every Customer】We value the customer shopping experience as top priority. For any questions about our soft farmhouse plaid comforter set, please feel free to contact us for an instant and satisfactory solution. Reminder: Since our products are vacuum packed, there might be slightly wrinkled that will disappear by simply placing the comforter on a ventilated place for about 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913AHHIauWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WRENSONGE","source_asin":"B0B9WCMYVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9WCMYVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9WCMYVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":193840,"name":"TMACTIME Fly Fans for Tables, Effective Fly Repellent Fan with Soft Blades Keeps Flies Away, Portable Fly Fan for Picnic, BBQ, Party (2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ioAxVfqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Keep Flies Away from Your Food】The TMACTIME fly fans for tables will keep you and your food free from flies. You can cook, eat or talk as much as you like without flies interrupting you in the area covered by the fan. Your food is also protected from flies by the fly repellent fan and remains intact. Therefore this is perfect for indoor or outdoor dining, camping and picnics. 【Holographic Fan Blades】The fan blades have some holographic patterns that can confuse flies. When the fly repellent fan starts to rotate, the holographic pattern will produce a light that can stimulate flies. To flies, such light is perverse and implies danger. Therefore, they will move away from the area after seeing these lights. Moreover, in order to ensure the normal operation of the fly fans for tables, the fan blades cannot be removed after they are installed. 【Soft Fan Blades and Quiet Rotation】The fan blades of fly repellent fan are made of superior quality material, textured but not sharp, soft but not fragile. So it doesn't hurt our hands. Furthermore, because of the special design, they do not make any sound when rotating, as quiet as if it did not start. The silent design provides a quiet environment for indoor dining and outdoor picnics, keeping the flies away without making a sound. 【Practical Soft-stop Technology】TMACTIME fly fan has a special technology which is soft-stop technology. This technology is to protect our hands and the fly fan itself. When an object touches the rotating blades, the fly fan will stop spinning immediately. And when the object leaves, the fly fan will spin again. Therefore when our hands touch the fan blades, it will not happen that our hands are injured by the fan blades and the fan blades are damaged. 【Hook Design and Portable】TMACTIME fly fan can be used not only on a flat surface, but also upside down on the ceiling. Considering that the fly fan will be used in the air, a hook is specially provided at the bottom of the fly fan for easy hanging. Moreover, TMACTIME fly fan can be folded and stored to reduce the use of space. Its straight body is actually soft, and it only needs a little power to shorten its body by half. Once shortened, it is easy to carry around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ioAxVfqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TMACTIME","source_asin":"B0C3LZKWK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3LZKWK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3LZKWK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
