window.products.push({"id":193864,"name":"R and D Handicrafts 5 String Marigold Garland Cempasuchil Pack Plus 4 Packs Authentic Mexican Banner Paper Papel Picado Fiesta Decoration 40 Multi Col","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91G0vpxvCbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Recycled Plastic Material 👍 WHAT YOU GET: Each packet contains 5 Dark Orange Marigold Garland Strands. Each String is just over 4FT in length for a total of 20+FT of garlands. The artificial flower Cempasúchil decorative garlands also come with 4 Packs of papel picado banners. Each Mexican papel picado banner is over 6FT in Length for over 25+FT with 10 Vibrant and Brightly authentic colored paper banners in each pack that will be the perfect addition to your fiesta decorations. 🎉 MEXICAN PARTY DECORATIONS: Over 25FT of Papel Picado Banners. The banner paper can be tied in rows or tied together for extra length. You can also intertwine the Papel Picado with the campusel Marigold Flowers just as in the pictures. The colores are energetic and the Flags are bright to make your fiesta party decorations and your guests immersed in the environment with the Mexican backdrop theme you always envisioned. 💀 Dia De Los Muertos: One of the most easily recognizable symbols of the Day of the Dead is the Marigold Flower and now you can your marigold flowers around all year round. You can use these garlands inside or outside. If you are decorating your Ofrenda these garlands in combination with the Papel Banners can be the exact thing you need. The colorful Pop that the Marigold Delivers are durable to keep around year after year. Your family and friends will love these decorations for the home. 🎈 FIESTA PARTY SUPPLIES: This multi-pack is one of a kind exclusive offer and combination pack that meets the needs of many different occasions. So whether you are celebrating a birthday and need a birthday banner or you are throwing a Fiesta and you want the most authentic Mexican Decorations you can find this variety pack is for you. Cinco De Mayo, day of the dead decorations, Coco party supplies, quinceañeras, Baptism, wedding arch flowers, Christmas, or Christening this is it. ❤️ Authentic Mexican Flags: The 4 Packs of Papel Picado in this pack will have you feeling the Authenticity. The Flags are not Plastic they are Paper. The Paper Flags flow much more freely in the wind and are much more appealing to the eye. These Mexican party banners are made of paper material that is never folded. They are lightweight, durable and you can use them over and over.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91G0vpxvCbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R and D Handicrafts","source_asin":"B084MF2CQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084MF2CQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084MF2CQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
