window.products.push({"id":193883,"name":"Fiossica Dual Compartment Lunch Box, Expandable Insulated Lunch Cooler Tote with Shoulder Strap, Leakproof Double Deck Lunch Cooler Tote Reusable Lunc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HByTWAcWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.[EXPANDABLE DOUBLE DECK LUNCH BOX]- Two insulated parts allow you to pack hot and cold food separately. The expandable top compartment is lined with food-grade aluminum foil, and the dual compartment lunch bag is very suitable for keeping fruits and snacks cold. The bottom is PEVA leak-proof lining, and the large compartment is ideal for lunch boxes and drinks. 2.[LEAK-PROOF & EASY TO CLEAN]- The Fiossica leak proof insulated meal bag is made of high-quality 600D polyester fabric and reinforced zippers to ensure maximum durability, uses eco-friendly Aluminum foil and PEVA lining, no BPA and PVC, easy to clean. The heat-welded seams to the inner compartment of lunch bag guard against leaks. This large lunch bag interior padded with thick insulation for keeping food stay cold/warm/fresh for hours. 3.[DOUBLE DECKER DESIGN]- The dual compartment design helps you organize your food. You can store bento containers or sandwiches on the bottom layer, while the top layer is more suitable for storing fruits or drinks. The dimension of the upper compartment are: 9.84*8.46*5.12 Inches/6.22 Inches(After Expanding) (length x width x height). The bottom compartment: 10.24*9.06*6.10 Inches 4.[SPACIOUS & VERSATILE]- ***The adjustable & removable strap and the durable handle with a soft pad provide convenience and more comfortable feeling at a long period carrying. *** 1 Zippered front pocket & 1 back mesh pocket with two velcros & 1 side mesh bottle holder with hook & loop & 1 side pouch for little items. You can deal with the insulated lunch bag cooler flexibly according to your needs. 5.[ATTENTION]- 1.Avoid contacting with sharp tools, such as knife, scissors and so on. 2.Avoid heavy pressure and being bent for a long time. 3.Keep the surface dry and clean. If it gets dirty, please wipe it with soft cloth. 4.Keep away from corrosive chemical, fire and high temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HByTWAcWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fiossica","source_asin":"B08GPTJMQT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GPTJMQT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GPTJMQT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
