window.products.push({"id":193887,"name":"Temperature Control Mug Travel Heating Cup LEJIEYIN Electric Heating Cup for Coffee in Car 12V Heated Mugs Smart Coffee Cup Keep Milk/Tea Warm LCD Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hl9wjYOEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍵 【INTELLIGENT TEMPERATURE CONTROL 】 12v coffee mug for car can be set from 86 °F to 194 °F, Keep the temperature at the heating completion temperature , no need to heat again, We recommend: Coffee 149 °, Tea 131 ° F, Baby milk powder 104 ° ,Fnoodles194 ° F,the 12v heated cup is very suitable for gifts, work, school, travel, camping, prepare milk for baby 🍵 【RAPID BOILING】The total capacity of the car electric mug is 13OZ, 12V 60W rapid heating, heated coffee cup takes about 7~8 minutes to heat to 122 ° F，only takes 15-25 minutes to heat a glass of water to 194 ° at room temperature,you can heat your coffee, milk, tea, or any drink to your favorite temperature on the go. 🍵【SAFE MATERIAL】The heated travel cupadopts grade 304 food-grade stainless steel inner pot , advanced internal pull-up technology, no weld seam inside,easy to clean,and the heated travel mug's wall system made of quality PP material clad protects users from scalding.Car heated coffee mug is quiet and no noise when heated. 🍵 【 EASY TO USE 】The heated smart mug uses \"+\" or \"- \" button to set temperature, LCD have two color model .LCD will display the actually temp and working status. RED is heating BLUE is constant your temp or standby. 【NOTE:The mug is equipped with a hidden vent, please do not turn the mug upside down to avoid burns caused by the hot water flowing out!】 🍵【INNER CUP CLEAN】We need to wash inner cup after we drink coffee,Screw out inner cup and you will take out stainless steel inner cup for washing.PLEASE NOTE- Put inner cup back after it dry and be sure assemble in place .Easy and Convenience. 🍵【SAFE FOR USE】Smart coffee mug system will shut off automatic when system test abnormal work.For example no water in mug, voltage too high or too low .Our system will stop and display error code\"ER\" ,you will have problem but not broken.Trouble Analysis and Solve please see \"Product Description\"or\"manual“ 🍵【MORE USE】Our 12v coffee cup just for 12V ,can't use for 24V bus or truck，Please choose our adapter or other suitable adapter (110v-12V6A) in market ,You will find error which review video display ,he use lower adapter so it can't use and display error code 🍵【GIFT OF THE BEST CHOICE 】Our travel heated mug has innovation and excellent quality, will be the perfect Christmas gift for your family and friends, colleagues, Thanksgiving gifts or birthday gifts. 🍵【PLEASE MESSAGE US 】We provide you with a 360-day warranty service.If you are in any way dissatisfied with your transaction with us before giving féẹd-báck. We endeavor to make our customers happy, and would appreciate the opportunity to rectify any issues that may occur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hl9wjYOEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEJIEYIN","source_asin":"B08R85FRF4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-193887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R85FRF4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R85FRF4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
